      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/McLaughlin%2C_South_Dakota"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Most Lakȟóta speakers refer to the town of McLaughlin as Makáȟleča or Matȟó Akíčita, meaning Bear Soldier.",
